title: "ultraship: Claude Code plugin for building, shipping, and scaling production software"
abstract: "All-in-one Claude Code plugin with 42 expert skills, 36 audit tools, and 12 agents. Covers SEO strategy (GSC + Bing + GA4 keyword intelligence, index doctor, AI traffic tracking), sprint workflow, safety guardrails, canary monitoring, pre-deploy auditing (SEO, security, penetration testing, code profiling), and project tooling."
